    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The information available to the local authority demonstrates\r\nthat the single storey rear extension at 5 Clewer Crescent, Harrow Weald,\r\nHarrow HA3 5QA was in situ and in use as part of the main dwellinghouse\r\nfor a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this\r\napplication on 25/08/2026. The single storey rear extension is therefore\r\nimmune from enforcement action under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning\r\nAct 1990 (as amended) and is lawful under Section 191 of the Town and Country\r\nPlanning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
